            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Sinh Thai Xuan Huong",
            "review_text": "Randall S\n24 contributions\n0\nA good nature can made this much ugly an unattended\nJul 2017 • Family\nActually nature of place is good. With a little effort this place can be a beautiful pearl. \n\nBut it they seems they prefered to make it a big open trash collecting area! A good nature can made this much ugly an unattended. \n\nEverywhere is with full of many long term waiting trash materials, nylon bags, thrown construction materials.. etc. Bad smell as well. \n\nAlthough everywhere is covered by many old trashes, funny but they put some trash cans too. But these cans outside looks even more dirty than trash itself :) \n\nWe saw environment and immediately escaped without sitting their very old and dirty chairs, tables also. We do not advise anybody to lose time with here.\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2017",
