            "review_text": "Stoylen\nOrsta, Norway96 contributions\n0\nFish restaurant attraction\nSep 2014 • Business\nThis place is hard to find!\n\nIt is an outdoor restaurant where you can catch your own fish. Rent or bring your own fishing-gear. Very popular among locals. \n\nNice place for a week-end lunch. Really an attraction for foreigners. The place is not on Google maps yet.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 14, 2014",
